      "content": "---\ntitle: Celestial Steel Ingot\nslug: celestial-steel-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Epic\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot (Alloy)\nmaterial_family: Celestial Steel\nsource_items:\n  - High Steel\n  - Celestial Essence\nweight: 1.3kg\nweight_class: Medium-Light\ndurability: Extreme\nenchantment_affinity: \"75% (+6 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: +4\narmor_modifier: +5\nmarket_value: 300–500 Marks (Restricted Trade)\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - epic\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Celestial Steel Ingot\n\n## Effect\nCelestial Steel is a refined divine alloy created by infusing High Steel with concentrated celestial essence. It represents a perfected form of Light-aligned material, offering superior protection, clarity, and stability.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nCelestial Steel appears as a luminous silver-white metal with faint golden undertones. Soft currents of light move beneath its surface, giving it a constant, calm radiance.\n\nThe metal reflects light cleanly without glare, creating a sense of clarity and purity rather than brilliance.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nCelestial Steel is the evolution of Celestial Bronze, forged by combining High Steel with celestial essence within divine forges. This process refines the metal beyond mortal limits, creating a material capable of channeling higher-order Light.\n\nIt is often reserved for relic weapons, divine armor, and artifacts tied to celestial forces or higher beings.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Extremely stable under magical influence  \n- Resistant to corruption and shadow  \n- Maintains clarity and structure under stress  \n- Balanced strength and refinement  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- High Steel  \n- Celestial Essence  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Defensive enchantments  \n  - Clarity and control of magic  \n- Weak interaction with Dark-aligned effects  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +4 Damage Modifier  \n- +5 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, balanced, and Light-aligned builds  \n\n---\n\n## Special Interaction\n- Increased effectiveness against **Infernal-aligned beings**  \n- Reduced effectiveness against Celestial-aligned entities  \n- Naturally resists corruption and curse effects  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires High Steel  \n- Requires Celestial Essence  \n- Must be forged within the **Celestial Realm**\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where bronze carries light — steel becomes it.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Celestial Steel Ingot\n\n## Effect\nCelestial Steel is a refined divine alloy created by infusing High Steel with concentrated celestial essence. It represents a perfected form of Light-aligned material, offering superior protection, clarity, and stability.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nCelestial Steel appears as a luminous silver-white metal with faint golden undertones. Soft currents of light move beneath its surface, giving it a constant, calm radiance.\n\nThe metal reflects light cleanly without glare, creating a sense of clarity and purity rather than brilliance.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nCelestial Steel is the evolution of Celestial Bronze, forged by combining High Steel with celestial essence within divine forges. This process refines the metal beyond mortal limits, creating a material capable of channeling higher-order Light.\n\nIt is often reserved for relic weapons, divine armor, and artifacts tied to celestial forces or higher beings.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Extremely stable under magical influence  \n- Resistant to corruption and shadow  \n- Maintains clarity and structure under stress  \n- Balanced strength and refinement  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- High Steel  \n- Celestial Essence  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Defensive enchantments  \n  - Clarity and control of magic  \n- Weak interaction with Dark-aligned effects  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +4 Damage Modifier  \n- +5 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, balanced, and Light-aligned builds  \n\n---\n\n## Special Interaction\n- Increased effectiveness against **Infernal-aligned beings**  \n- Reduced effectiveness against Celestial-aligned entities  \n- Naturally resists corruption and curse effects  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires High Steel  \n- Requires Celestial Essence  \n- Must be forged within the **Celestial Realm**\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where bronze carries light — steel becomes it.\"*",
