      "searchTerms": "chromium ingot item resources & materials metal metal ingots {\"title\":\"chromium ingot\",\"slug\":\"chromium-ingot\",\"type\":\"item\",\"kingdom\":\"material\",\"itemclass\":\"uncommon\",\"category\":\"ingot\",\"subcategory\":\"metal\",\"materialtype\":\"metal\",\"materialform\":\"ingot\",\"materialfamily\":\"chromium\",\"sourceitems\":[\"chromium ore\"],\"weight\":\"1.2kg\",\"weightclass\":\"medium\",\"durability\":\"high\",\"enchantmentaffinity\":\"15% (+1 dice)\",\"damagemodifier\":1,\"armormodifier\":2,\"marketvalue\":\"18 marks\",\"tags\":[\"items\",\"materials\",\"metal\",\"ingot\",\"uncommon\"],\"visibility\":\"public\"} # chromium ingot\n\n## effect\nchromium ingots are used to reinforce metals, increasing durability and resistance to environmental and structural damage. while not suited for raw offensive power, they significantly enhance defensive properties.\n\n---\n\n## crafting use\n- armor reinforcement  \n- structural components  \n- alloy enhancement (high steel)  \n- defensive equipment  \n\n---\n\n## material traits\n- excellent corrosion resistance  \n- strengthens alloy integrity  \n- maintains form under stress  \n- slightly heavier than standard metals  \n\n---\n\n## alloy use\n- [[high steel ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## enchantment use\n- improves enchantment durability  \n- reduces wear from repeated magical use  \n- supports defensive enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## combat integration\n- +1 damage modifier  \n- +2 armor modifier  \n- strong defensive-focused material  \n\n---\n\n## crafting source\n- requires: 4x [[chromium ore]]\n\n---\n\n## quote\n*\"strength is not in the strike — but in what endures it.\"*"
