        "Effect": "Dragon Glass is a draconic crystalline alloy created through an advanced variation of the Glass forging process. By combining Pyraxx Sand and Aluminum under intense dragonfire, smiths produce a material infused with primal heat and destructive draconic energy.\n\nThe result is a highly aggressive alloy capable of channeling immense thermal force while maintaining razor-sharp precision.\n\n---",
        "Appearance": "Dragon Glass appears as jet-black crystalline metal threaded with glowing crimson and ember-orange veins beneath its surface. These veins pulse faintly like molten magma trapped within dark obsidian.\n\nWhen exposed to heat, combat, or draconic presence, the internal glow intensifies and spreads throughout the material.\n\nThe surface reflects light unevenly, giving the metal a living and volatile appearance.\n\n---",
