      "searchTerms": "lead ingot item resources & materials metal metal ingots {\"title\":\"lead ingot\",\"slug\":\"lead-ingot\",\"type\":\"item\",\"kingdom\":\"material\",\"itemclass\":\"common\",\"category\":\"ingot\",\"subcategory\":\"metal\",\"materialtype\":\"metal\",\"materialform\":\"ingot\",\"materialfamily\":\"lead\",\"sourceitems\":[\"lead ore\"],\"weight\":\"1.5kg\",\"weightclass\":\"heavy\",\"durability\":\"moderate\",\"enchantmentaffinity\":\"5% (+0 dice)\",\"marketvalue\":\"8 marks\",\"tags\":[\"items\",\"materials\",\"metal\",\"ingot\",\"common\"],\"visibility\":\"public\"} # lead ingot\n\n## effect\nlead ingots are used to suppress and contain magical energy rather than enhance it.\n\n---\n\n## crafting use\n- anti-magic items\n- sealed containers\n- cursed relics\n\n---\n\n## material traits\n- heavy and dense  \n- soft but stable  \n- magic dampening  \n\n---\n\n## enchantment use\n- reduces magical output  \n- blocks magical effects  \n\n---\n\n## crafting source\n- requires: 4x [[lead ore]]\n\n---\n\n## quote\n*\"silence, forged into matter.\"*"
