        "Lore": "Once refined, Necronium becomes one of the most dangerous materials in existence. It is not forged from the earth, but from accumulated death itself.\n\nWeapons and armor made from Necronium are feared across realms, as they do not simply harm — they erode life directly.\n\n---",
        "Material Traits": "- Reacts to living essence  \n- Drains vitality on sustained contact  \n- Stable under necrotic influence  \n- Weak under intense Light-aligned energy  \n\n---",
        "Enchantment Use": "- Exceptional affinity with **Death**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Life-drain  \n  - Decay  \n  - Curse-based effects  \n- Poor interaction with Light-aligned enchantments  \n\n---",
