      "searchTerms": "platinum ingot item resources & materials metal metal ingots {\"title\":\"platinum ingot\",\"slug\":\"platinum-ingot\",\"type\":\"item\",\"kingdom\":\"material\",\"itemclass\":\"uncommon\",\"category\":\"ingot\",\"subcategory\":\"metal\",\"materialtype\":\"metal\",\"materialform\":\"ingot\",\"materialfamily\":\"platinum\",\"sourceitems\":[\"platinum ore\"],\"weight\":\"1.1kg\",\"weightclass\":\"medium\",\"durability\":\"high\",\"enchantmentaffinity\":\"40% (+3 dice)\",\"damagemodifier\":1,\"armormodifier\":2,\"tags\":[\"items\",\"materials\",\"metal\",\"ingot\",\"uncommon\"],\"visibility\":\"public\"} # platinum ingot\n\n## effect\nplatinum is a rare and highly stable metal that excels in magical conductivity. it enhances divine and celestial enchantments while maintaining structural integrity.\n\n---\n\n## crafting use\n- holy weapons\n- relics\n- enchanted armor\n- magical cores\n\n---\n\n## material traits\n- highly resistant to corruption  \n- extremely stable under magical stress  \n- difficult to forge without advanced methods  \n\n---\n\n## alloy use\n- high-tier enchanted alloys (future)\n\n---\n\n## enchantment use\n- strong affinity with light and celestial magic  \n- increases enchantment effectiveness  \n- high stability under repeated casting  \n\n---\n\n## combat integration\n- +1 damage modifier\n- +2 armor modifier\n- favours enchanted builds over raw damage  \n\n---\n\n## crafting source\n- requires: 4x [[platinum ore]]\n\n---\n\n## quote\n*\"purity forged into form.\"*"
