      "content": "---\ntitle: Pure Silver Ingot\nslug: pure-silver-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Rare\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Pure Silver\nsource_items:\n  - Pure Silver Ore\nweight: 1.0kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"65% (+5 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 2\narmor_modifier: 3\nmarket_value: 68 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - rare\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Pure Silver Ingot\n\n## Effect\nPure Silver Ingots produce a refined metal that channels Light with exceptional clarity. It excels in purification, protection, and revealing hidden or corrupted forces.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nPure Silver Ingots are smooth and highly refined, with a bright, mirror-like surface that reflects light cleanly and evenly. Unlike other metals, the reflection appears crisp and undistorted, giving it a sense of clarity and purity.\n\nA faint, steady glow lingers along the surface, most noticeable in darkness, as if the metal itself carries a quiet, internal light.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Holy weapons  \n- Radiant armor  \n- Anti-corruption tools  \n- Divine or celestial equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight and highly refined  \n- Maintains purity under normal conditions  \n- Slightly softer than combat-focused metals  \n- Reacts strongly to corruption and shadow  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Illumination  \n  - Anti-corruption effects  \n- Weak synergy with Dark-aligned enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, support, and anti-corruption builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Pure Silver Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where it touches, truth is laid bare.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Pure Silver Ingot\n\n## Effect\nPure Silver Ingots produce a refined metal that channels Light with exceptional clarity. It excels in purification, protection, and revealing hidden or corrupted forces.\n\n---\n## Appearance\nPure Silver Ingots are smooth and highly refined, with a bright, mirror-like surface that reflects light cleanly and evenly. Unlike other metals, the reflection appears crisp and undistorted, giving it a sense of clarity and purity.\n\nA faint, steady glow lingers along the surface, most noticeable in darkness, as if the metal itself carries a quiet, internal light.\n\n---\n## Crafting Use\n- Holy weapons  \n- Radiant armor  \n- Anti-corruption tools  \n- Divine or celestial equipment  \n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Lightweight and highly refined  \n- Maintains purity under normal conditions  \n- Slightly softer than combat-focused metals  \n- Reacts strongly to corruption and shadow  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Exceptional affinity with **Light** magic  \n- Enhances:\n  - Purification  \n  - Illumination  \n  - Anti-corruption effects  \n- Weak synergy with Dark-aligned enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +2 Damage Modifier  \n- +3 Armor Modifier  \n- Favours defensive, support, and anti-corruption builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Pure Silver Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where it touches, truth is laid bare.\"*",
