      "content": "---\ntitle: Zinc Ingot\nslug: zinc-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Zinc\nsource_items:\n  - Zinc Ore\nweight: 0.9kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"10% (+0 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 6 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Zinc Ingot\n\n## Effect\nZinc Ingots are rarely used alone but are critical in crafting alloys that require flexibility and responsiveness.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Alloy component\n- Artificer crafting\n- Mechanical parts\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Soft and reactive  \n- Low durability  \n- Enhances alloy flexibility  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Brass Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Improves energy responsiveness in alloys  \n- Helps distribute magical effects evenly  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Zinc Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"The unseen force behind the perfect alloy.\"*\n",
