        "Material Traits": "- Extremely dense and difficult to move  \n- Resistant to physical and environmental degradation  \n- Maintains structural integrity under immense force  \n- Nearly impossible to refine using standard methods  \n\n---",
        "Refinement": "- Smelts into: [[Adamantium Ingot]]  \n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot  \n- Requires divine-grade or deep-earth forge conditions  \n\n---",
