      "content": "---\ntitle: Copper Ore\nslug: copper-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Copper\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Copper Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"15% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 2 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Copper Ore\n\n## Effect\nCopper Ore contains trace conductive veins that respond strongly to heat and energy. When refined, it produces a metal highly suited for elemental channeling and early enchantment work.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nKnown as the *“First Flame Ore,”* copper was the first material mortals learned to draw from the earth and shape with fire. It represents the birth of craft and the beginning of all metallurgy.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Easily mined and refined  \n- High impurity content → refinement loss  \n- Strong elemental conductivity (Fire / Lightning)  \n- Core material for early crafting systems  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Copper Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Standard impurity loss during smelting\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Bronze Ingot]]\n- [[Brass Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances low-tier elemental enchantments  \n- Improves mana flow in crafted items  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"From the earth’s spark, all craft begins.\"*\n",
      "body": "# Copper Ore\n\n## Effect\nCopper Ore contains trace conductive veins that respond strongly to heat and energy. When refined, it produces a metal highly suited for elemental channeling and early enchantment work.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nKnown as the *“First Flame Ore,”* copper was the first material mortals learned to draw from the earth and shape with fire. It represents the birth of craft and the beginning of all metallurgy.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Easily mined and refined  \n- High impurity content → refinement loss  \n- Strong elemental conductivity (Fire / Lightning)  \n- Core material for early crafting systems  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Copper Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Standard impurity loss during smelting\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Bronze Ingot]]\n- [[Brass Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances low-tier elemental enchantments  \n- Improves mana flow in crafted items  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"From the earth’s spark, all craft begins.\"*",
