        "Appearance": "Red Duranium Ore appears as dense, dark metallic stone threaded with deep crimson veins that pulse faintly beneath the surface.\n\nThese veins glow brighter when exposed to combat, heat, or living creatures, giving the ore the appearance of a slow, burning heartbeat trapped within stone.\n\nFragments of the ore remain unnaturally warm even during cold nights within the desert.\n\n---",
