        "Material Traits": "- Naturally resonates with mana currents  \n- Stable under astral and planar energies  \n- Excellent magical conductivity  \n- Difficult to refine without precise forge control  \n\n---",
        "Refinement": "- Smelts into: [[Starite Ingot]]  \n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot  \n- Requires astral forge or celestial refinement process  \n\n---",
