      "content": "---\ntitle: Wanderer\ntype: origin\ncategory: Travel Origin\nvisibility: public\ntags:\n  - origin\n  - travel\n  - survival\n---\n\n# Wanderer\n\n## Overview\nWanderers grew up moving between roads, settlements, wild regions, and half-known routes.\n\n## Background\nThey often know how to read weather, find shelter, and recognise danger before it reaches camp.\n\n## Story Hooks\n- Lost family route\n- Old road debt\n- Map fragment to a forgotten place\n\n",
