        "Racial Traits": "### Amphibious Nature\nUniden can breathe both air and water, easily adapting between land and aquatic environments.\n\n### Waterborne Healing\nWhen immersed in a natural source of water (like rivers or rain), Undines are able to regenerate health quicker:\n- In combat: +3 HP per round  \n- Out of combat: +10 HP per round",
