        "Traits & Biology": "- Flight-based movement (primary mobility)  \n- Highly agile, erratic movement pattern  \n- Can hover and change direction instantly  \n\n⚠️ Limitations:\n- Vulnerable in strong winds  \n- Reduced effectiveness in confined spaces  \n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Drawbacks\n- Very fragile (low HP potential)  \n- Extremely low strength  \n- Reliant on magic and positioning  \n- Vulnerable if grounded or restrained  \n\n---\n\n> \"Fate doesn’t guide us… it dances with us.\"\n— Lirael, Emberwing Pixie",
