      "searchTerms": "tempestborn undien race  {\"title\":\"tempestborn undien\",\"slug\":\"tempestborn-undien\",\"type\":\"race\",\"racecategory\":\"demi races\",\"secondarycategory\":\"undien races\",\"tertiarycategory\":\"\",\"playable\":true,\"size\":\"\",\"movement\":\"9m\",\"languages\":[],\"magicaffinity\":[\"storm\",\"lightning\",\"water\"],\"essenceaffinity\":[],\"tags\":[\"race\",\"demi-races\",\"undien-races\"],\"images\":\"\",\"male\":\"assets/races/tempestborn-undien/tempestborn-undien-male-adult.png\",\"female\":\"assets/races/tempestborn-undien/tempestborn-undien-female-adult.png\",\"visibility\":\"public\",\"sourceorder\":182} # tempestborn undien\n\n## overview\n- race category: demi-race\n- race type: spiritborn humanoid\n- parent race: tempest spirit × humanoid\n- playable: yes\n- rarity: rare\n\n## racial features\n- height range:\n  - male: 175cm - 205cm\n  - female: 165cm - 195cm\n\n- weight range:\n  - 65kg - 110kg\n\n- skin:\n  - smooth skin infused with storm mana\n  - faint electrical energy may dance across the body during heightened emotions\n  - colour range:\n    - storm grey\n    - slate blue\n    - silver grey\n    - pale blue\n    - thundercloud black\n\n- hair:\n  - constantly appears windswept\n  - often crackles with static electricity\n  - colour range:\n    - white\n    - silver\n    - blue\n    - black\n    - dark grey\n\n- eyes:\n  - bright and luminous\n  - often glow during storms\n  - colour range:\n    - electric blue\n    - silver\n    - white\n    - violet\n    - golden yellow\n\n- hands:\n  - long dexterous fingers\n  - often emit tiny static discharges\n\n- face:\n  - sharp features\n  - intense expressions\n  - highly expressive eyes\n\n- ears:\n  - slightly elongated\n  - wind-shaped fin ridges\n\n- markings:\n  - lightning-like bioluminescent patterns\n  - glow brightly during spellcasting\n  - most commonly appear along arms, neck, chest, and face\n\n- body:\n  - lean athletic build\n  - fast reflexes\n  - constant subtle movement even when standing still\n\n---\n\n## racial characteristics\n| characteristic | buff/debuff | stat rolls | characteristics tier cap |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| strength       | +2          | 4d6        | tier 3                   |\n| dexterity      | 0           | 3d6        | tier 4                   |\n| agility        | 0           | 3d6        | tier 5                   |\n| constitution   | 0           | 4d6        | tier 4                   |\n| endurance      | +2          | 4d6        | tier 5                   |\n| intelligence   | -2          | 4d6        | tier 4                   |\n| wisdom         | 0           | 4d6        | tier 5                   |\n| charisma       | +1          | 4d6        | tier 4                   |\n| luck           | 0           | 3d6        | tier 5                   |\n\n---\n\n## racial traits\n### water spirit heritage\n\n#### description\nevery undien carries a fragment of a water spirit's soul, granting an unbreakable connection to water magic. this spiritual bond forms the foundation of every undien lineage from birth.\n\n#### effects\n- gain **100% water magic affinity**.\n- water is permanently one of your natural elemental affinities.\n- this affinity cannot be removed or replaced by any normal means.\n\n---\n\n### amphibious\n\n#### description\nthe essence of a water spirit allows every undien to live effortlessly between land and sea, breathing naturally in both environments without restriction or discomfort throughout their lifetime.\n\n#### effects\n- can breathe underwater indefinitely.\n- can breathe air normally.\n- cannot drown through natural causes.\n\n---\n\n### storm sense\n\n#### description\ntempestborn instinctively perceive atmospheric changes before they occur. their connection to the skies allows them to sense storms, shifting winds, and dangerous weather long before others notice.\n\n#### effects\n- gain advantage on survival checks involving weather prediction.\n- can sense approaching storms up to 24 hours in advance.\n- always know the current wind direction and approximate wind strength.\n- gain advantage on perception checks during storms, heavy rain, or high winds.\n\n---\n\n### stormforged constitution\n\n#### description\nborn beneath relentless storms, tempestborn have bodies adapted to rain, humidity, and violent weather. their storm-blessed constitution protects them from illnesses and hardships carried by the elements.\n\n#### effects\n- gain immunity to natural illnesses caused by wet, cold, or humid environments.\n- gain immunity to diseases contracted through contaminated water.\n- gain advantage on checks to resist weather-related exhaustion.\n- ignore environmental penalties caused by heavy rain, thunderstorms, strong winds, and severe storms.\n\n---\n\n### lightning reflexes\n\n#### description\nstorm energy races through every tempestborn, granting extraordinary speed and lightning-fast reactions. their movements are sudden, precise, and as unpredictable as the storms from which they were born.\n\n#### effects\n- gain **+2 initiative**.\n- gain **+1 agility**.\n- gain advantage on reaction-based agility checks.\n- reduce fall damage by **50%**.\n\n---\n\n## lore\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## culture\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## historical figures\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## settlements\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## relations\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## traits & biology\n- swim speed: 18m\n- ignore difficult terrain caused by storms and heavy rain.\n- gain +3m movement speed during storms.\n- suffer no penalties from strong winds.\n- can maintain balance on unstable surfaces during severe weather.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ bonuses\n- enhanced storm magic\n- enhanced lightning magic\n- exceptional mobility\n- superior reflexes\n- advanced weather awareness\n\n### ⚠️ drawbacks\n- emotionally volatile during intense storms.\n- lightning-based magical overload can occur during extreme mana usage.\n- less tolerant of enclosed underground environments.\n- often struggle with patience and long periods of inactivity.\n\n---\n\n## gallery\ninformation coming soon.\n\n## gm notes\ngm-only information coming soon."
