      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Quick Assembly\"\nslug: \"quick-assembly\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 2\"\ntier: \"Tier 2\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Resources or Gadgeteering\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Reduces setup time and improves field assembly options by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Supports field gadgets, emergency repairs, quick workshop setup, and combat preparation.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-2\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 9\n---\n\n# Quick Assembly\n\n## Overview\nReduces setup time and improves field assembly options by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nAssemble simple Artificer devices faster in the field.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove rapid repair and temporary build reliability.\n\n## Rank 3\nCreate more complex field-ready devices.\n\n## Rank 4\nReduce setup time for advanced creations.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster rapid assembly under pressure.\n\n## Prerequisites\nResources or Gadgeteering\n\n## Scaling\nReduces setup time and improves field assembly options by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nSupports field gadgets, emergency repairs, quick workshop setup, and combat preparation.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
