      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Resources\"\nslug: \"resources\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 1\"\ntier: \"Tier 1\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"None\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Improves access to, recovery of, and efficient use of crafting resources.\"\nsynergy: \"Supports long-term crafting, field repairs, workshop play, and campaign resource management.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-1\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 5\n---\n\n# Resources\n\n## Overview\nImproves access to, recovery of, and efficient use of crafting resources.\n\n## Rank 1\nImprove basic material recovery and resource preparation.\n\n## Rank 2\nReduce waste while crafting and salvaging.\n\n## Rank 3\nRecover more usable materials from field work.\n\n## Rank 4\nImprove rare material preparation and storage.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster resource efficiency across Artificer projects.\n\n## Prerequisites\nNone\n\n## Scaling\nImproves access to, recovery of, and efficient use of crafting resources.\n\n## Synergy\nSupports long-term crafting, field repairs, workshop play, and campaign resource management.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
