      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Scaling Creation\"\nslug: \"scaling-creation\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 4\"\ntier: \"Tier 4\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Soul Bond Object Rank 3\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Allows creations to improve through investment, soul energy, or campaign progression.\"\nsynergy: \"Connects Artificer creations to item growth, soul systems, and long-term character progression.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-4\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 17\n---\n\n# Scaling Creation\n\n## Overview\nAllows creations to improve through investment, soul energy, or campaign progression.\n\n## Rank 1\nCreate an item or device with early scaling potential.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove scaling stability and growth path clarity.\n\n## Rank 3\nSupport more advanced upgrade routes.\n\n## Rank 4\nConnect creations to stronger campaign progression hooks.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster scaling creations suitable for legendary development.\n\n## Prerequisites\nSoul Bond Object Rank 3\n\n## Scaling\nAllows creations to improve through investment, soul energy, or campaign progression.\n\n## Synergy\nConnects Artificer creations to item growth, soul systems, and long-term character progression.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n",
